WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:09.150
Payments inbox: every payment by any method: receipts, confirmations, refunds and open payment requests.

2
00:00:09.702 --> 00:00:14.610
Filter to "To review"; receipts customers sent are here.

3
00:00:15.157 --> 00:00:22.230
Compare the receipt with your bank account; if right, "Confirm", otherwise "Reject" with a reason.

4
00:00:22.779 --> 00:00:29.620
To ask for money, click "Request payment"; "Open payment requests" shows payments still waiting.

5
00:00:30.167 --> 00:00:36.590
Confirm only when the money is actually in your account; a receipt photo alone isn't enough.
